# Deferred-work bundle: brief-derivation-concurrency

bundle_name: brief-derivation-concurrency
dw_ids: DW-112

## Intent

Make first-time Brief persistence idempotent by project and inputs hash. convex/generations.ts:1565 checks reuse in a separate query, while :1684 inserts version 1 unconditionally. Recheck inside the persistence transaction and stamp concurrent generations to the authoritative Brief, with a concurrent-first-derivation regression.

